  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1c48f655d92fd4db296dc049bfbb1ede, type: 3}
  itemDescription: Artificial Intelligence and Robotics Institute  This institute
    is at the forefront of AI and robotics research, aiming to develop intelligent
    systems and autonomous machines. Its mission spans artificial intelligence algorithms
    (machine learning, natural language processing, computer vision) and robotics
    design (humanoid, service, and industrial robots). Focus areas include developing
    Arabic language AI models, AI solutions for healthcare and finance, autonomous
    drone and vehicle navigation, and collaborative robots for industry. The institute
    supports national priorities by creating AI tools that can be adopted in government
    and business, and by prototyping robots for sectors like education, healthcare,
    and security. Ultimately, it works to ensure Saudi Arabia is a producer of advanced
    AI tech and smart robotics, not just a consumer
  description: 
